# What the worker image build (worker/Dockerfile) may see. Docker uses this
# file instead of the root .dockerignore because it sits next to that
# Dockerfile. Allow-list: everything else is left out.
*

!package.json
!package-lock.json
!.npmrc
!src/lib/shared
!worker/src
!worker/tsconfig.json
!worker/runtime-deps.mjs

# Never secrets or junk.
**/.env*
**/*.pem
**/*.key
**/node_modules
**/*.log
**/*.md
worker/dist
